 "insight": [
  "The value per kg of Luxembourg's fuel imports increased from 0.40 €/kg in 2005 to 0.79 €/kg in 2025.",
  "Over the period 2005 to 2025, the value per kg rose by 96.1%.",
  "The largest year-to-year increase occurred between 2021 and 2022, when the value jumped from 0.60 €/kg to 0.87 €/kg.",
  "The peak value was reached in 2023 at 0.93 €/kg, before slightly declining in 2024 and 2025.",
  "The data only includes trade rows where quantities are known, so some volumes and unit values are missing."
